    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.:Wa/L/2/Ath/17.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      395.6,
      286.4,
      474.8
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose. Description of the Land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      476.24,
      286.43,
      578.23
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 385 allotment in total extent of about 11.5688 Hectares, of land in Final Village Plan No. 87, Supplement No. 10 and Lot Nos. 114, 117 in total extent of about 10.7230, of land in Final Village Plan No. 80, Supplement No. 06, prepared by the Surveyor General Situated in the Village of Gammana in the Divisonal Secretary\u2019s Division of Walallawita in Kaluthara District in Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      579.4,
      331.88,
      667.99
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 385 Name of Land: Dediyaowita, Gammanwelaowita, Liyanagedara alias Gamanwelaowita, Gangaaddaradeniya, Kadolakerewa alias Gangaaddaradeniya and Benthara-gangaaddaradeniya; Description: Jungle and Wetland; Original Claimant: Cannot be found; Extent: 11.5688 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      331.28,
      540.33,
      387.44
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 114 Name of Land: Kadola, Ambagasthuduwekumbura and Kiriligahaowita; Description: Jungle and Wetland; Original Claimant: Cannot be found; Extent: 8.3570 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      388.64,
      540.32,
      444.8
    ],
    "text": "3. Lot No. 117 Name of Land: Kadola, Kiriligahaowita; Description: Jungle and Wetland; Original Claimant: Cannot be found; Extent: 2.3660 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      446.24,
      595.07,
      582.8
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Walallawita on 23rd November, 2016 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 16th November, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      583.06,
      529.8,
      620.72
    ],
    "text": "D. R. JAYASINGHE, Divisional Secretary, Walallawita.",
